    "$t": "<span style=\"font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">李美嬌</span></span><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></b>\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.20382021949626505\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">花紅無意為君suí，色褪怎驚無蜂khîⁿ</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">粒積果功蒼生獻，春醒花開福祿迎</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">花開花謝是過程，得意失意走馬燈</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">心頭掠定向善行，有情社會蔭眾生</span></b>"
